OL,3,GNEWSAManchester Half Marathon: What you
OL,4,Aneed to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of runners is set to
OL,7,Ftake on the Manchester Half Marathon
OL,8,Fthis October.
OL,10,F32,000 people have signed up for the
OL,11,Fevent, which will see them take on 13.1
OL,12,Fmiles (21km) on mainly flat roads,
OL,13,Fthrough Trafford and south Manchester.
OL,15,FIt has almost tripled in participant
OL,16,Fnumbers since it first started in 2016.
OL,18,FOrganisers said about #1.5m was raised
OL,19,Flast year for national and local
OL,20,Fcharities. Here is everything you need
OL,21,Fto know for this year's event.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
